A handler cannot select an older instance with compatible type arguments
effect Reader(a::Abs) { Ask : () => a; } handle(handle(do Ask + 1) { case <Ask => k> -> k(true) }) { case <Ask => k> -> k(42) }
stderr : @.*Type error:.*
exit : 1

